        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6552 Mortise Baltimore Entry Set with 5015 Half-Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Classic Estate Collection Baltimore Entry Set will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". It is available in single cylinder and dummy set functions. The classic rectangular design when paired with the 5015 half-round knob make this entry set perfect for traditional homes. Built with the quality you'd expect from Baldwin, the 6552 Baltimore Entrance Set has a lifetime limited warranty on the workmanship, mechanical operation, and the PVD Polished Brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own products.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/classic-2-inch-knobset-baldwin-5000\"><b>Baldwin 5000 Door Knobset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional 6552 Baltimore Door Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-duty mortise lock body.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt with two hardened inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with two keys.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Estate Collection Baltimore Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5015 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .187\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6552.pdf?v=1691094973\" target=\"new\"><b>Baltimore Entry Set Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-2-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"250\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Baltimore Mortise Entry Set, Baldwin 6552",
                "description": "Baldwin 6552 Baltimore Entry Set - This Classic Estate Collection Baltimore Entry Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in single cylinder and dummy set functions. The classic rectangular design when paired with the 5015 half-round knob make this entry set perfect for traditional homes. Built with the quality you'd expect from Baldwin, the 6552 Baltimore Entrance Set has a lifetime limited warranty on the workmanship, mechanical operation, and the PVD Polished Brass finish.",
